sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator as Platform operator
    participant UI as Operations UI
    participant API as Platform operations API
    participant Backup as Backup provider or local dump
    participant Restore as Disposable restore database
    participant Verify as Verification checks
    participant Audit as Evidence record

    Operator->>UI: Start backup/restore drill
    UI->>API: Submit scoped tenant and drill metadata
    API->>Backup: Create or select backup artifact
    Backup-->>API: Backup id, timestamp, integrity metadata
    API->>Restore: Restore into isolated disposable database
    Restore-->>API: Restore completed
    API->>Verify: Check migrations, tenant data, indexes, and isolation
    Verify-->>API: Verification result and measured duration
    API->>Audit: Record backup, restore, RPO/RTO evidence, and operator
    Audit-->>UI: Evidence summary and remediation state
    UI-->>Operator: Pass, fail, or blocked result

    Note over Backup,Restore: A restore drill must not overwrite an active tenant database.